  "title": "Arteris Named to Fast Company’s Annual List of the World’s Most Innovative Companies of 2026",
  "summary": "Arteris has been recognized on Fast Company’s 2026 list of the World’s Most Innovative Companies, ranking #4 in North America alongside industry leaders like Google, Nvidia, and more. The recognition highlights the company’s leadership in advancing semiconductor innovation, particularly through technologies like FlexGen smart network-on-chip IP and expanded chiplet integration and cybersecurity solutions. With its technology deployed in billions of chips worldwide, Arteris continues to address the growing complexity and security demands of AI-driven silicon design. Learn more in the press release.",
